The specific JS concept is classList — a property every DOM element has, giving you a small set of methods to manage its CSS classes:

.add("className") — attaches a class
.remove("className") — detaches a class
.toggle("className") — adds it if absent, removes it if present
.contains("className") — checks if the element currently has that class (returns true/false)




