<style>
    body {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        width: 800px; /* 16 squares × 50px each */
    }
</style>


display: flex — tells the browser "lay out this element's children in a row, side by side" (similar spirit to Bootstrap's row/col classes you've already used).




